137–138"},{"key":"source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Lemma 6.2, pp. 129–130; scans 137–138"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 为字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83639a9615c06195\" href=\"?note=83639a9615c06195\" title=\"73-df-cfg-language-class\">73-df-cfg-language-class</a>。对词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span>，标记位置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\{0,\\ldots,|w|-1\\}\">\\(D\\subseteq\\{0,\\ldots,|w|-1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_D:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(m_D:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 在断言中定义，词运算见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ogden\\text{-}marked\\text{-}pumping}\\vdash\nm_D(i,j)\\coloneqq|D\\cap\\{k\\in\\mathbb N:i\\le k&lt;j\\}|\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ogden\\text{-}marked\\text{-}pumping}\\vdash\nm_D(i,j)\\coloneqq|D\\cap\\{k\\in\\mathbb N:i\\le k&lt;j\\}|\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ogden\\text{-}marked\\text{-}pumping}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall w\\in L\\;\\forall D\\subseteq\\{0,\\ldots,|w|-1\\}\\;\\Bigl[|D|\\ge p\\Longrightarrow\\exists u,v,x,y,z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\bigl(&amp;w=uvxyz\\\\&amp;\\land m_D(|u|,|uv|)+m_D(|uvx|,|uvxy|)\\ge1\\\\&amp;\\land m_D(|u|,|uvxy|)\\le p\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;uv^nxy^nz\\in L\\bigr)\\Bigr].\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ogden\\text{-}marked\\text{-}pumping}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall w\\in L\\;\\forall D\\subseteq\\{0,\\ldots,|w|-1\\}\\;\\Bigl[|D|\\ge p\\Longrightarrow\\exists u,v,x,y,z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\bigl(&amp;w=uvxyz\\\\&amp;\\land m_D(|u|,|uv|)+m_D(|uvx|,|uvxy|)\\ge1\\\\&amp;\\land m_D(|u|,|uvxy|)\\le p\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;uv^nxy^nz\\in L\\bigr)\\Bigr].\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>在 CNF 树中只沿有标记后代的分支走，在两个子树均含标记时优先走标记较多的一支。足够多的分叉点保证重复非终结符；选最后一段重复得到局部标记数上界。被泵的两段至少含一个标记，防止把泵动作移到无关区域。这里只形式化原书所给的弱版本。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"83639a9615c06195","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":